Q. Given an array arr[] and an integer k, count the number of subarrays whose sum is divisible by k.

Example 1:-
arr = [4, 5, 0, -2, -3, 1]
k = 5
Output: 7

Approach:
The solution follows the arithmetic equation i.e., if we consider pf[i] = sum[0...i] = a & pf[j] = sum[0...j] = b where i<j
=> (a - b) % k = 0
=> (a % k) - (b % k) = 0
=> a % k = b % k